IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ha61-nouns`
IMPORT `ha61-cross-references`

-- Row il-61. The controls hold, and the recorded facts about the three items are what NOTES.md says they are.
-- The three items themselves are NOT asserted sound anywhere in this file: their six failing assertions are in ha61-tests-xrefs-red.l4.
-- Every expected value is written from the texts quoted in ha61-cross-references.l4 (the `ext:` and `src:` lines), not from the output of the module.

§ `Item I1: the entries of the list in s 4(א)`

-- What the records say: the consolidation prints the entry 4ב and an official instruction deletes it; the target is printed as cancelled by the consolidation of the Disabled Persons Law.
#ASSERT (`list entry 4ב in s 4(א)`)'s `the entry` EQUALS "4ב"
#ASSERT (`list entry 4ב in s 4(א)`)'s `the consolidation prints it in the list`
#ASSERT (`list entry 4ב in s 4(א)`)'s `an official instruction read by this row deletes it from the list`
#ASSERT NOT (`list entry 4ב in s 4(א)`)'s `an official instruction read by this row adds it to the list`
#ASSERT (`list entry 4ב in s 4(א)`)'s `what the consolidation of the law named prints for the section` EQUALS `it prints the section as cancelled`
#ASSERT (`list entry 4ב in s 4(א)`)'s `limb (a) was read from` EQUALS `the consolidation only`
#ASSERT (`list entry 4ב in s 4(א)`)'s `limb (b) was read from` EQUALS `an official instrument read from its page image; what the consolidation prints today is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`
-- The control: the words the same instruction adds are printed in the list by the consolidation, and the instruction does not delete them.
#ASSERT (`list entry 5א in s 4(א)`)'s `the consolidation prints it in the list`
#ASSERT (`list entry 5א in s 4(א)`)'s `an official instruction read by this row adds it to the list`
#ASSERT NOT (`list entry 5א in s 4(א)`)'s `an official instruction read by this row deletes it from the list`
#ASSERT (`list entry 7ב עד 7ו in s 4(א)`)'s `the consolidation prints it in the list`
#ASSERT (`list entry 7ב עד 7ו in s 4(א)`)'s `an official instruction read by this row adds it to the list`
#ASSERT NOT (`list entry 7ב עד 7ו in s 4(א)`)'s `an official instruction read by this row deletes it from the list`
#ASSERT `the number of entries of the list in s 4(א) that the consolidation prints and an official instruction adds` EQUALS 2
-- Counting over the list: one entry the consolidation prints and an official instruction deletes; the two control entries alone would give none.
#ASSERT `the number of entries of the list in s 4(א) that the consolidation prints and an official instruction deletes` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instruction deletes it from the list` (`list entry 5א in s 4(א)`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instruction deletes it from the list` (`list entry 7ב עד 7ו in s 4(א)`) EQUALS 0
-- No entry of the list is repealed or amended by an instrument read by this row (only deleted from the list, or added to it).
#ASSERT NOT (`list entry 4ב in s 4(א)`)'s `an official instrument read by this row repeals the section it names`

§ `Item I2: the entries of the list in s 7(א)`

-- What the records say: the consolidation prints the entry 22 and an official instrument repeals the section it names.
#ASSERT (`list entry 22 in s 7(א)`)'s `the entry` EQUALS "22"
#ASSERT (`list entry 22 in s 7(א)`)'s `the consolidation prints it in the list`
#ASSERT (`list entry 22 in s 7(א)`)'s `an official instrument read by this row repeals the section it names`
#ASSERT (`list entry 22 in s 7(א)`)'s `the instrument that says so` EQUALS "section 2 of the instrument printed in Sefer HaChukim 2118, printed p. 36"
#ASSERT NOT (`list entry 22 in s 7(א)`)'s `an official instruction read by this row deletes it from the list`
#ASSERT (`list entry 22 in s 7(א)`)'s `limb (a) was read from` EQUALS `an official instrument, read from its page image`
#ASSERT (`list entry 22 in s 7(א)`)'s `what the consolidation of the law named prints for the section` EQUALS `not read by this row`
-- Controls. The entry 10: printed, and the instrument that repeals 22 amends it instead of repealing it.
#ASSERT (`list entry 10 in s 7(א)`)'s `the consolidation prints it in the list`
#ASSERT (`list entry 10 in s 7(א)`)'s `an official instrument read by this row amends the section it names`
#ASSERT NOT (`list entry 10 in s 7(א)`)'s `an official instrument read by this row repeals the section it names`
#ASSERT `one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instrument repeals the section it names` (`list entry 10 in s 7(א)`) EQUALS 0
-- The entry 9ג: printed, and the 2026 item (3)(א) adds it to the list.
#ASSERT (`list entry 9ג in s 7(א)`)'s `the consolidation prints it in the list`
#ASSERT (`list entry 9ג in s 7(א)`)'s `an official instruction read by this row adds it to the list`
#ASSERT `one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instruction adds it to the list` (`list entry 9ג in s 7(א)`) EQUALS 1
-- The entry 29ה: the 2026 instrument repeals the section and deletes the entry from the list, and the consolidation does not print it in the list.
#ASSERT NOT (`list entry 29ה in s 7(א)`)'s `the consolidation prints it in the list`
#ASSERT (`list entry 29ה in s 7(א)`)'s `an official instruction read by this row deletes it from the list`
#ASSERT (`list entry 29ה in s 7(א)`)'s `an official instrument read by this row repeals the section it names`
#ASSERT `one if the consolidation prints the entry and an official instrument repeals the section it names` (`list entry 29ה in s 7(א)`) EQUALS 0
-- The 2026 item (3)(א) does not delete the entry 22 from the list: no instruction read by this row does.
#ASSERT NOT (`list entry 22 in s 7(א)`)'s `an official instruction read by this row deletes it from the list`
-- Counting over the list: one entry the consolidation prints whose section an instrument repeals.
#ASSERT `the number of entries of the list in s 7(א) that the consolidation prints and an official instrument repeals the section of` EQUALS 1

§ `Item I3: the grant of 200,000 new shekels and the grant of 550,000 new shekels`

-- The amounts: the consolidation and the 2016 instrument print the same amount; the 2011 instrument prints another amount in its subsection (ג).
#ASSERT (`the 200,000-shekel grant as the consolidation prints it`)'s `the amount in new shekels` EQUALS 200000
#ASSERT (`the 200,000-shekel grant as the 2016 instrument inserts it`)'s `the amount in new shekels` EQUALS 200000
#ASSERT `the two amounts agree` (`the 200,000-shekel grant as the consolidation prints it`) (`the 200,000-shekel grant as the 2016 instrument inserts it`)
#ASSERT (`the 550,000-shekel grant in subsection (ג) of s 4 of the 2011 instrument`)'s `the amount in new shekels` EQUALS 550000
-- Where each text puts the grant: the consolidation in subsection (ד1) of section 4א of the Law; the 2016 instrument as (ד2) in section 4 of the 2011 instrument; the 2011 instrument's own (ג) in its section 4.
#ASSERT (`the 200,000-shekel grant as the consolidation prints it`)'s `the section it is put in` EQUALS "4א"
#ASSERT (`the 200,000-shekel grant as the consolidation prints it`)'s `the subsection it is put in` EQUALS "(ד1)"
#ASSERT (`the 200,000-shekel grant as the 2016 instrument inserts it`)'s `the section it is put in` EQUALS "4"
#ASSERT (`the 200,000-shekel grant as the 2016 instrument inserts it`)'s `the subsection it is put in` EQUALS "(ד2)"
#ASSERT (`the 550,000-shekel grant in subsection (ג) of s 4 of the 2011 instrument`)'s `the subsection it is put in` EQUALS "(ג)"
-- The green control: the 2016 instrument's insertion and the 2011 instrument's (ג) are put in the same law and the same section, as each page prints.
#ASSERT `the two texts put the grant in the same law` (`the 200,000-shekel grant as the 2016 instrument inserts it`) (`the 550,000-shekel grant in subsection (ג) of s 4 of the 2011 instrument`)
#ASSERT `the two texts put the grant in the same section` (`the 200,000-shekel grant as the 2016 instrument inserts it`) (`the 550,000-shekel grant in subsection (ג) of s 4 of the 2011 instrument`)
-- Where each reading comes from.
#ASSERT (`the 200,000-shekel grant as the consolidation prints it`)'s `read from` EQUALS `the consolidation only`
#ASSERT (`the 200,000-shekel grant as the 2016 instrument inserts it`)'s `read from` EQUALS `an official instrument, read from its page image`
#ASSERT (`the 550,000-shekel grant in subsection (ג) of s 4 of the 2011 instrument`)'s `read from` EQUALS `an official instrument, read from its page image`

§ `Tests of the date pairs`

-- Each Hebrew date printed with a Gregorian date gives that Gregorian date in the routine, and the printed pairs are the ones typed.
#ASSERT `the printed pair matches the routine` (`date pair: the footer of printed p. 614 of Sefer HaChukim 3072`)
#ASSERT `the printed pair matches the routine` (`date pair: the footer of printed p. 799 of Sefer HaChukim 3549`)
#ASSERT `the printed pair matches the routine` (`date pair: the footer of printed p. 36 of Sefer HaChukim 2118`)
#ASSERT `the printed pair matches the routine` (`date pair: the footer of printed pp. 272 to 273 of Sefer HaChukim 3493`)
#ASSERT `the printed pair matches the routine` (`date pair: the footer of printed p. 1160 of Sefer HaChukim 2573`)
#ASSERT `the printed pair matches the routine` (`date pair: the footer of printed pp. 992 to 993 of Sefer HaChukim 2307`)
#ASSERT `the printed pair matches the routine` (`date pair: the date in the text of printed p. 993 of Sefer HaChukim 2307`)
#ASSERT (`date pair: the footer of printed p. 614 of Sefer HaChukim 3072`)'s `the Hebrew date, transliterated` EQUALS "14 Av 5783"
#ASSERT (`date pair: the footer of printed p. 614 of Sefer HaChukim 3072`)'s `the Gregorian date printed with it` EQUALS Date 1 8 2023
#ASSERT (`date pair: the footer of printed p. 799 of Sefer HaChukim 3549`)'s `the Gregorian date printed with it` EQUALS Date 19 7 2026
#ASSERT (`date pair: the footer of printed p. 36 of Sefer HaChukim 2118`)'s `the Gregorian date printed with it` EQUALS Date 25 11 2007
#ASSERT (`date pair: the footer of printed pp. 272 to 273 of Sefer HaChukim 3493`)'s `the Gregorian date printed with it` EQUALS Date 28 1 2026
#ASSERT (`date pair: the footer of printed p. 1160 of Sefer HaChukim 2573`)'s `the Gregorian date printed with it` EQUALS Date 11 8 2016
#ASSERT (`date pair: the footer of printed pp. 992 to 993 of Sefer HaChukim 2307`)'s `the Gregorian date printed with it` EQUALS Date 28 7 2011
#ASSERT (`date pair: the date in the text of printed p. 993 of Sefer HaChukim 2307`)'s `the Gregorian date printed with it` EQUALS Date 1 10 2000
-- Issue order: the instrument that deletes the word from the list (item I1) is issued before the one that adds a subsection (ג) to section 4.
#ASSERT (`date pair: the footer of printed p. 614 of Sefer HaChukim 3072`)'s `the Gregorian date printed with it` LESS THAN (`date pair: the footer of printed p. 799 of Sefer HaChukim 3549`)'s `the Gregorian date printed with it`
-- Item I2: the instrument that repeals section 22 is issued before the one that repeals section 29ה and edits the list.
#ASSERT (`date pair: the footer of printed p. 36 of Sefer HaChukim 2118`)'s `the Gregorian date printed with it` LESS THAN (`date pair: the footer of printed pp. 272 to 273 of Sefer HaChukim 3493`)'s `the Gregorian date printed with it`
-- Item I3: the 2011 instrument is issued before the 2016 one.
#ASSERT (`date pair: the footer of printed pp. 992 to 993 of Sefer HaChukim 2307`)'s `the Gregorian date printed with it` LESS THAN (`date pair: the footer of printed p. 1160 of Sefer HaChukim 2573`)'s `the Gregorian date printed with it`
-- The date in the text of printed p. 993 comes before the issue date of that instrument.
#ASSERT (`date pair: the date in the text of printed p. 993 of Sefer HaChukim 2307`)'s `the Gregorian date printed with it` LESS THAN (`date pair: the footer of printed pp. 992 to 993 of Sefer HaChukim 2307`)'s `the Gregorian date printed with it`
#ASSERT (`date pair: the footer of printed p. 614 of Sefer HaChukim 3072`)'s `the pair was read from` EQUALS `an official instrument, read from its page image`
